"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3YcHCH8oAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3IcHCH4oCQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3IcHCIABKAo",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3IcHCIEBKAs",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3IcHCIIBKAw",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3YcHCIQBKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q3IcHCIMBKA0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["評價：拉麵迷的噩夢！一碗 $310 的「工廠培根麵」，衛生意識極差\n\n被 IG Reels 推薦吸引，結果卻是大型詐騙現場。身為拉麵迷，這是我吃過最沒誠意、最不尊重「職人精神」的一間店。\n\n❌ 食物：$310 吃工廠代工，是在開玩笑？\n\n火遁爆辛拉麵 $310\n• 培根假冒叉燒： 一碗麵賣到 $310，叉燒竟然是用培根做的！培根味完全壓過湯頭，這根本是培根湯麵，不是拉麵。\n• 當面拆包裝蛋： 我親眼看著廚師直接在我面前拆開塑膠包裝袋倒出溏心蛋。蛋煮到全熟（Overcooked）像滷蛋一樣，連裝一下自家做的樣子都沒有，毫無誠意。\n• 湯頭與辣度： 湯少得可憐，味淡如水。點了大辣卻一點也不辣，最後只能靠七味粉救場。\n\n木葉秘傳煎餃 ($120)\n完全的冷凍水準，沒什麼好說的。\n\n❌ 衛生：長髮＋口水，食安零分\n坐在吧台（屋台位）真的會被廚房景象嚇死：\n• 頭髮亂飄： 廚師留長髮（有一位甚至及腰），卻不收進帽子裡，任由長髮在身前晃動。一想到頭髮可能掉進麵裡，胃口全無。\n• 聊天沒口罩： 廚師煎餃子時沒戴口罩且一直聊天，口水直接噴進煎鍋裡，基本衛生意識蕩然無存。\n\n❌ 環境與效率：設計不良，出餐混亂\n• 座位侷促： 屋台位置極小，後面的掛簾一直卡脖子。\n• 出餐極慢： 兩個人沒分工，煎餃等了 20 分鐘。連旁邊桌的客人都吃完麵了，飲料才送上。\n\n總結：\n這家店 CP 值為 0，純粹靠火影 IP 坑錢。看到旁邊客人也都在搖頭發負評（真的有人跟我一樣在忍受這一切），就知道不是我的要求高，而是這家店真的太差。已從 Google Map 儲存清單移除，永不回訪！",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4934,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb6fb21fe49ca6373!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNBNDRKb2FMcmtUYXNZWlRYRkZVdkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRILMGUtNFF2R205ci0aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rTkJORFJLYjJGTWNtdFVZWE5aV2xSWVJrWlZka0USCzBlLTRRdkdtOXItIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARc2PKSf4h-7YqCzBlLTRRdkdtOXIt\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8QoykIhQEoDg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiN3tWGs9eWAxWtd14EHTaBN08Q0pMFCCgoAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjpv8-Gs9eWAxW2kq8BHcT3DB8Q0pMFCGwoAg"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WlVHVndUbkk1VlROR2VDMURSRTgzUTBSSU0yYxAB",["0x0:0xb6fb21fe49ca6373",null,1769252634474062,1769320815387399,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106235209505161939338/r